OL,3,AFinland orders halt to work on two
OL,4,AGoogle data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinnish authorities have ordered a halt
OL,7,Fto building work at two planned Google
OL,8,Fdata centres amid concerns over the
OL,9,Fclearance of more than 300 hectares of
OL,10,Fforest.
OL,12,FThe sites form part of Google's record
OL,13,FbB,13bn (#11bn; $15bn) investment in
OL,14,FFinland, announced less than a month
OL,15,Fago and described by the company as its
OL,16,Flargest single investment in Europe.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
