OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFinland orders halt to work on two
OL,4,AGoogle data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Finnish Supervisory Agency (LVV)
OL,7,Fsaid work at one site was carried out
OL,8,Fwithout a mandatory environmental
OL,9,Fimpact assessment and ordered measures
OL,10,Fthat would "significantly alter the
OL,11,Fenvironment" to be suspended by 23
OL,12,FOctober.
OL,14,FGoogle said it had "fallen short of our
OL,15,Fown high standards in this instance"
OL,16,Fand would follow the agency's guidance.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
